---
title: "Frame sender: groups and keyframe wait"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Waiting for a keyframe, 0 queued
  s1: Group open, 1 queued
  s2: Group open, 0 queued
  s3: Group open, 2 queued
  s4: Waiting for a keyframe, 2 queued
  s5: Waiting for a keyframe, 1 queued
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: keyframe opens a group
  s1 --> s2: writes a frame
  s1 --> s3: queues a frame
  s2 --> s1: queues a frame
  s3 --> s1: writes a frame or new keyframe resets the group
  s3 --> s4: viewer behind: drops a frame, ends the group
  s4 --> s5: writes a frame
  s4 --> s1: keyframe opens a group
  s5 --> s0: writes a frame
  s5 --> s1: keyframe opens a group
